NOTE – October 2026

I’m Jochai (“marlowe”), creator and original lead developer of Fantasy Worlds: Rhynn and founder of macrolutions Ltd., the company that published it.

The Rhynn revival I’m involved in is Rhynn-X (https://rhynn-x.com), developed by Mindaugas Deltuva (DESOFTLAB) together with me. A formal licence for Rhynn-X and an updated LICENSE for this repository are being put in place. Until then the existing LICENSE applies unchanged — note that it does not permit using the original graphics or the names “Rhynn” / “Fantasy Worlds: Rhynn” in public projects.

– marlowe, October 2026

